    "date": 1768888290,
    "caption": "📈 Want to learn how to accelerate your startup’s growth, build a strong strategy, and approach investors with confidence?\n\nJoin our workshop with Danil Kislinskiy — founder & CEO of Go Global World, a San Francisco Bay Area–based entrepreneur and investor.\n\n💡 Go Global World, a Berkeley SkyDeck portfolio company, is transforming how founders raise venture capital through AI-powered solutions. The platform is already live and helps startups increase investor visibility by leveraging a proven network of trusted connections.\n\nA special workshop held as part of the Her Silicon Valley Pitch online pitching event, organized by Sisters, a Central Asian female founders community from Silicon Valley, and is designed to help participants strengthen their ideas and prepare for their presentations.\n\n✅ During the workshop, we will cover how to build a growth strategy, position your startup effectively, and approach investors with confidence.\n\n🇺🇸 The workshop will be held in English.\n\n🔗 The participation link will be sent after registration.\n\n📝 Register via the link in the profile header (see the “Events” section)",
